  "notes": {
    "sdganext20261013-gettysburg-country-club-qualification": "Individually classified Public by SDGA. Physical hole total and component inventory are unknown; front/back ratings, par and playing-round lengths do not establish physical counts. County, property point and arrival remain unknown. The profile carries both Public and Semi-Private labels; the individual Public label is the admission evidence. Combined street and PO Box address purpose remains unspecified.",
    "sdganext20261013-golf-club-at-red-rock-qualification": "Individually classified Public by SDGA. Physical hole total and component inventory are unknown; front/back ratings, par and playing-round lengths do not establish physical counts. County, property point and arrival remain unknown. Rapid City locality is published, but the street address is blank.",
    "sdganext20261013-hillcrest-golf-country-club-qualification": "Individually classified Public by SDGA. Physical hole total and component inventory are unknown; front/back ratings, par and playing-round lengths do not establish physical counts. County, property point and arrival remain unknown. Yankton city/ZIP-only text does not establish a street address. Existing Fox Run in Yankton has a different name, street and operator.",
    "sdganext20261013-parkston-country-club-qualification": "Individually classified Public by SDGA. Physical hole total and component inventory are unknown; front/back ratings, par and playing-round lengths do not establish physical counts. County, property point and arrival remain unknown. The listed operator URL is unvisited; its historical TLS stop remains active. Independent association evidence does not clear that operator.",
    "sdganext20261013-prairie-ridge-golf-course-qualification": "Individually classified Public by SDGA. Physical hole total and component inventory are unknown; front/back ratings, par and playing-round lengths do not establish physical counts. County, property point and arrival remain unknown. The individual Public label is corroborated by a Non-Base guest category. No current fee, unrestricted base-entry or live-availability claim.",
    "sdganext20261013-rivers-bend-country-club-qualification": "Individually classified Public by SDGA. Physical hole total and component inventory are unknown; front/back ratings, par and playing-round lengths do not establish physical counts. County, property point and arrival remain unknown. Flandreau locality differs from River Ridge in Garretson and Two Rivers in Dakota Dunes. Listed Facebook link excluded.",
    "sdganext20261013-the-lakes-golf-course-qualification": "Individually classified Public by SDGA. Physical hole total and component inventory are unknown; front/back ratings, par and playing-round lengths do not establish physical counts. County, property point and arrival remain unknown. Wentworth locality differs from the same-named Kentucky facility and other South Dakota lake-name facilities; the street address is blank."
  },
